#   0x4C003D4A. That interpreter reads a MIDI-SHAPED byte stream from
#   the queue 0x500AD39C -- status & 0xF0 selects 0x90 note-on (->
#   TgPartKeyEvent), 0xA0, 0xB0, 0xC0 program change, 0xD0, 0xE0, 0xF0
